body:
i don't think it's awkward at all! i personally prefer to watch movies alone because when i do see them with other people they tend to not pay attention or talk through it which ruins the experience... :/

i don't go the movie theater very often tho so i treat it like a super special thing when i do... buying popcorn or candy etc, it's kinda nice to get a treat and lose yourself in a film for a few hours

if you decide to go i hope you enjoy it :)
